+## Global Constraints
+- ESM, Node ≥22. Degrade-safe: missing Supabase ⇒ clean 200 `{ok:false,skipped:true}` (client GETs ⇒ 200 `{ok:false,reason}`); admin ⇒ 401 fail-closed. Never 5xx.
